Description: Supports the book 'Analyzing Spatial Models of Choice and Judgment' 
    (2nd Edition), CRC Press (2024). Provides tools for spatial analysis of 
    political choice and judgment data, including scaling methods and 
    diagnostic tools for multidimensional analysis.
